  "method": "Annual subway ridership plus NYC Transit bus plus MTA Bus Company ridership. 2014-2018 are the annual totals in the three summary tables on MTA's 2019 ridership page; 2019-2025 are sums of the twelve monthly values for agencies 'Subway', 'NYCT Bus' and 'MTA Bus' in the MTA monthly dataset (years with fewer than 12 months are left out). The two sources agree on 2019 (checked within 0.5%). 2025 was 72.6% of 2019. latest_extra compares the sum of daily Subway and Bus counts from 1 January through the dataset's latest date (2026-11-12) with the same dates a year earlier.",
  "caveats": [
    "Staten Island Railway, commuter rail and paratransit are excluded.",
    "The MTA daily dataset (sayj-mze2) starts on 1 March 2020, so it cannot give full-year 2020; the monthly dataset is used for every year from 2019 so the series has one consistent source. Annual sums of the daily data differ from the monthly totals by: 2021 subway -0.0%, bus -0.4%; 2022 subway -0.1%, bus -0.4%; 2023 subway -0.2%, bus -0.3%; 2024 subway -0.1%, bus -0.0%; 2025 subway +0.0%, bus -0.8%.",
    "Pre-2014 annual totals were not used: the MTA pages carrying them could not be retrieved.",
    "2020-2022 reflect the pandemic collapse and recovery."
